<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Central Bank lowers 5-day term rate.</title>
<headline>Manila Central Bank lowers 5-day term rate.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank said on Thursday it lowered its five-day reverse repo rate to 10.25 percent from 10.5 percent.</p>
<p>Earlier, the Central Bank cut its overnight rates by 0.25 percentage points.</p>
<p>The Central Bank left its other term rates from one to six months unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
